laurel 2910: sandbox privileges by entitlement: socket delegate, kernel pipe, system override (on top of 2903).

Boot 20:02 of 2026-11-01 still denied these three. Each binary carries the entitlement a real iOS kernel asks for [V strings
of the 20H392 binaries]: 10001 PRIV_NET_PRIVILEGED_SOCKET_DELEGATE com.apple.private.network.socket-delegate (nsurlsessiond,
cloudd, dasd, itunesstored, identityservicesd, mediaserverd), 12001 PRIV_SKYWALK_REGISTER_KERNEL_PIPE
com.apple.private.skywalk.register-kernel-pipe (identityservicesd, rapportd), 1003 PRIV_SYSTEM_OVERRIDE
com.apple.private.kernel.system-override (mediaserverd). No entitlement: still denied, with the first-denial line. Not granted:
10003 PRIV_NET_PRIVILEGED_NETWORK_STATISTICS (symptomsd): no feature here, more wakeups. Kill switch: laurelsandbox=0, the switch
of 2903. Line: "LAUREL SANDBOX: privileges 1002/1007/12000 + entitled 1003/10001/12001 on, extension tokens on", and one
"LAUREL SANDBOX: <process> privilege <n> granted (first grant)" per privilege.

diff --git a/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c b/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c
--- a/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c
@@ -426,6 +426,17 @@
  *   12000 PRIV_SKYWALK_REGISTER_USER_PIPE  register a Skywalk user pipe nexus.
  *        identityservicesd, rapportd. Processes with the entitlement
  *        com.apple.private.skywalk.register-user-pipe.
+ * laurel 2910: three more, by the entitlement each binary of 20H392 carries for
+ * it (docs/laurel_sprout/system-features.md; denied in boot 20:02 of 2026-11-01):
+ *   10001 PRIV_NET_PRIVILEGED_SOCKET_DELEGATE  a socket or NECP client acts for a
+ *        client app. nsurlsessiond, cloudd, dasd, itunesstored (background
+ *        URLSession downloads run for an app). com.apple.private.network.socket-delegate.
+ *   12001 PRIV_SKYWALK_REGISTER_KERNEL_PIPE  identityservicesd.
+ *        com.apple.private.skywalk.register-kernel-pipe.
+ *   1003 PRIV_SYSTEM_OVERRIDE  system_override(2) while the camera or audio runs.
+ *        mediaserverd. com.apple.private.kernel.system-override.
+ * Not granted: 10003 PRIV_NET_PRIVILEGED_NETWORK_STATISTICS (symptomsd; no feature
